  "fullDescription": "Unleash the beauty of realistic gouache painting on your iPad with the Gouache Procreate Brushes set! This collection includes 24 versatile brushes designed to give you the authentic feel of gouache paint. Enjoy a variety of brush shapes, including wide and thin, round and flat, and specialized filbert grainer and stipple brushes for unique textures.\n\nEach brush replicates real gouache effects like creamy, jelly, smudged, and watered paint, along with glazing techniques to add stunning layering and depth. Whether you’re working on delicate details or bold textures, these brushes are made for every art trick in the book!\n\nUnlock your creativity and find your unique style with Gouache Procreate Brushes, designed to help you explore your artistic potential!\n\nHow To Use:\n1. Download the files on your iPad\n2. Click on .brushset files\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list",
